# Online title search (Search › Movies & TV) uses TMDB. Copy this file to tmdb.properties (which git
# ignores) and put your own key in it. The TMDB_API_KEY environment variable works too.
# Get a free key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api. Either the API key or the API read
# access token works. Without a key, Leios builds as normal and online search stays hidden.
tmdbApiKey=
